#: src/build.py:17
msgid "Detect the project build system (meson, cmake, autotools, cargo, go, npm, make) and run a local compile."
msgstr "Deteksi sistem build proyek (meson, cmake, autotools, cargo, go, npm, make) dan jalankan kompilasi lokal."

